<footer class="contact-section" id="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-title"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="contact-topline"><span class="section-index">07 / OPEN A CONVERSATION</span><span>MUMBAI, INDIA · OPEN TO CONVERSATIONS</span></div>
      <div class="contact-layout">
        <div class="contact-intro">
          <h2 id="contact-title">Good things<br>start with<br><em>a hello.</em></h2>
          <p>A project to build. A problem to untangle. An idea you can't leave alone. Tell me what's on your mind.</p>
          <div class="contact-direct"><span>PREFER YOUR OWN INBOX?</span><a href="mailto:hello@iamgaurav.online">hello@iamgaurav.online <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><button class="copy-email" id="copy-email" type="button">Copy email <span aria-hidden="true">⧉</span></button><span class="copy-status" id="copy-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="contact-console">
          <div class="console-chrome"><span class="console-dots" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span>gaurav / conversations</span><span class="console-channel">NEW MESSAGE</span></div>
          <div class="console-body">
            <div class="console-command" aria-hidden="true"><span>→</span> start conversation<span class="console-cursor"></span></div>
            <p class="console-welcome">A small introduction.<br>A possibility on the other side.</p>
            <form id="contact-form" novalidate>
              <div class="console-field"><label for="contact-name"><span aria-hidden="true">01</span> Your name</label><input id="contact-name" name="name" autocomplete="name" placeholder="What should I call you?" required maxlength="80" aria-describedby="contact-name-error"><span class="field-error" id="contact-name-error"></span></div>
              <div class="console-field"><label for="contact-email"><span aria-hidden="true">02</span> Your email</label><input id="contact-email" name="email" type="email" inputmode="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="you@example.com" required maxlength="254" aria-describedby="contact-email-error"><span class="field-error" id="contact-email-error"></span></div>
              <div class="console-field"><label for="contact-message"><span aria-hidden="true">03</span> What's on your mind?</label><textarea id="contact-message" name="message" rows="4" placeholder="The idea, the challenge, or just a hello..." required minlength="10" maxlength="5000" aria-describedby="contact-message-error"></textarea><div class="message-meta"><span class="field-error" id="contact-message-error"></span><span id="contact-count">0 / 5000</span></div></div>
              <div class="contact-trap" aria-hidden="true" inert><label for="contact-website">Leave this empty</label><input id="contact-website" name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></div>
              <div class="console-send-row"><span class="console-readiness" id="contact-readiness">0 of 3 fields ready</span><button id="contact-send" type="submit"><span id="contact-send-label">Send message</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button></div>
              <p class="contact-privacy">Your details are used to reply to your message and send a confirmation email. No mailing list.</p>
              <p class="contact-status" id="contact-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
              <noscript><p class="contact-status">Email me directly at <a href="mailto:hello@iamgaurav.online">hello@iamgaurav.online</a>.</p></noscript>
            </form>
            <div class="console-receipt" id="contact-receipt" hidden tabindex="-1">
              <span class="receipt-mark" aria-hidden="true">↗</span><span class="receipt-eyebrow">CONVERSATION STARTED</span><h3>Over to me.</h3><p>Thanks, <span id="receipt-name"></span>. Your message is on its way to my inbox.</p><p class="receipt-note">A thank-you email is on its way to <strong id="receipt-email"></strong>. You can reply to it to keep the conversation going.</p><div class="receipt-rule"></div><span class="receipt-signature">Gaurav Jadhav</span><button id="contact-another" type="button">Write another message <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="console-foot"><span><i aria-hidden="true"></i> HUMAN AT THE OTHER END</span><span>ONE GOOD CONVERSATION AT A TIME</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="footer-bottom"><span>© <span id="year">2026</span> Gaurav Jadhav</span><div><a href="https://github.com/jadhavgaurav" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/gauravjadhav007" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a><a href="#top">Back to top</a></div><span>Thoughtfully built. Still evolving.</span></div>
    </div></footer>
